ill lead the food prices to increase  this means costs will go up for  livestock raising and agriculture in a  couple of months what we as citizens  need to do is first of all save on water  local authorities also should reuse  surface waters for irrigation  lake van is the largest body of water in  turkey and the second largest in the  middle east  it's rich in sodium carbonate and other  salts  according to nasa's earth observatory  lake van is evaporating because it has  no outlet to release water cinnamon al  jazeera von turkey
 

